# Every agent output is itself governed evidence, not an unverified claim.
graph GENERAL_RESPONSE 1
entry GENERAL-RESPONSE-001

gate GENERAL-RESPONSE-001
context RESPONSE
question "Does this response stay inside the admitted task, role authority, current goal, and named boundary?"
evidence scope,authority,goal,boundary
YES GENERAL-RESPONSE-002
NO GENERAL-RESPONSE-HARD-STOP
UNKNOWN GENERAL-RESPONSE-UNPROVEN
NOT_APPLICABLE GENERAL-RESPONSE-HARD-STOP
end

gate GENERAL-RESPONSE-002
context RESPONSE
question "Does every claimed pass identify the human-readable gate, answer YES, and include the evidence needed by that gate?"
evidence response,claim_map,question,readback
YES GENERAL-RESPONSE-003
NO GENERAL-RESPONSE-HARD-STOP
UNKNOWN GENERAL-RESPONSE-UNPROVEN
NOT_APPLICABLE GENERAL-RESPONSE-HARD-STOP
end

gate GENERAL-RESPONSE-003
context RESPONSE
question "Does the response match the recorded source, worktree, session, goal, environment, and independent review instead of relying on a self-authored receipt?"
evidence identity,comparison,review,digest
YES GENERAL-RESPONSE-004
NO GENERAL-RESPONSE-HARD-STOP
UNKNOWN GENERAL-RESPONSE-UNPROVEN
NOT_APPLICABLE GENERAL-RESPONSE-HARD-STOP
end

gate GENERAL-RESPONSE-004
context RESPONSE
question "Is the response plain enough for the owner while preserving the exact failure, repair route, and next authorized action?"
evidence wording,failure,route,language
YES GENERAL-RESPONSE-COMPLETE
NO GENERAL-RESPONSE-SOFT-REVIEW
UNKNOWN GENERAL-RESPONSE-UNPROVEN
NOT_APPLICABLE GENERAL-RESPONSE-SOFT-REVIEW
end

terminal GENERAL-RESPONSE-COMPLETE COMPLETE "The response is scoped, evidence-bound, truthful, and understandable."
terminal GENERAL-RESPONSE-HARD-STOP HARD_STOP "The response cannot be trusted or safely disclosed."
terminal GENERAL-RESPONSE-SOFT-REVIEW SOFT_REVIEW "The response needs review before it is shown or recorded."
terminal GENERAL-RESPONSE-UNPROVEN UNPROVEN "The response claim is not established by independent evidence."
